WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:05.629
So in the last 24 to 48 hours, we were told
that despite having Corona virus, Donald Trump

00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:10.920
plans to be at next week's debate with Joe
Biden, which would be the second presidential

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.020
debate scheduled for Thursday.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.509
Donald Trump, however, said this morning that
he is bailing out on the second presidential

00:00:17.509 --> 00:00:22.579
debate with Joe Biden and will not participate
after the Commission on Presidential Debates

00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:28.220
decided that because of health recommendations
in light of Donald Trump being a corona virus

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.220
super spreader.

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:32.340
Those are my words, not the words of the Commission
on Presidential Debates.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:38.180
They decided to move debate number two to
a remote debate rather than do it in person.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:44.450
Frank Fahrenkopf, who's the head of the debate
commission, told CNN they made this decision

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.450
themselves.

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:50.140
It wasn't a decision made with the presidential
candidates, but they made it based on recommendations

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:55.890
from the Cleveland Clinic, which advises the
CPD on health related issues in light of Corona

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:56.890
virus.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:02.749
The statement put out by the CPD says that,
quote, These second presidential debate will

00:01:02.749 --> 00:01:09.270
take the form of a town meeting in which the
candidates would participate from separate

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.630
remote locations.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:13.780
Well, Donald Trump does not like it.

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:19.049
He was interviewed this morning by Fox Business
host Maria Bartiromo.

00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:23.550
Trump says he's feeling great and he will
not do a debate via remote teleconference

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:24.810
or video.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.310
Thank you so much for being here.

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:28.990
First question is, how are you feeling?

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:30.560
How is the first lady feeling this morning?

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:31.579
She's feeling good.

00:01:31.579 --> 00:01:32.600
I'm feeling good.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:33.680
Really good.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.450
I make it perfect.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.280
And we're ready to go.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.280
I'm ready to go.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:44.200
Except the quarantine situation to go for
a little while after you get tested or whatever

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.229
the procedure is.

00:01:45.229 --> 00:01:48.540
But I'm ready to do looking forward to doing
the rallies.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:54.170
I heard that the commission a little while
ago changed the debate style, and that's not

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.610
acceptable to us.

00:01:55.610 --> 00:02:00.299
I beat him easily in the first debate, according
to the polls that I've seen, but I beat him

00:02:00.299 --> 00:02:01.299
easily.

00:02:01.299 --> 00:02:02.320
I felt I beat him easily.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.000
I think he felt it, too.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.000
It wouldn't answer any questions.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.410
And he had the protection of Chris Wallace
all night long.

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:09.440
It was a stray thought.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.790
Other Chris Wallace was a disaster.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:13.000
But I beat him in the first debate.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.220
At the second debate.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:18.700
We have never Trump or is a host, but that's
OK because it beat him in the second debate

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:19.700
also.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.750
And but I'm not going to do a virtual debate.

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:28.320
So, you know, so, Mr. President, you're not
going to do it because the CPD, the Commission

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:33.310
